<title>CANADA: Hungarian prime minister to visit Canada.</title>
<headline>Hungarian prime minister to visit Canada.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian Prime Minister Gyula Horn will visit Canada from Feb. 9 to 13, Canadian Prime Minister Jean Chretien announced on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It will be the first official visit to Canada by a Hungarian prime minister.</p>
<p>Canadian companies have invested over Canadian $200 million (U.S. $150 million) in Hungary and trade is growing.</p>
</text>
